					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p><strong>皮囊之下</strong><br /> <strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662783&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609314932" alt="TimeElapsed" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662783)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed" >TimeElapsed</a></span></p> <p>世界线相互交织，最终形成不知属于谁的可悲的故事。</p> <p>图自己画的，CC-BY-SA 3.0。（不过这图也太简单了2333）</p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>彼端，来自三个不同世界尽头的残片相互碰撞。</p> <p>世界线相互交织，最终形成不知属于谁的可悲的故事。</p> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tmflws/cyc.png" style="width:750px" alt="cyc.png" class="image" /></div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/quirk-in">其一 破灭</a></span></h3> <h3><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:travellers-book-fools">其二 归墟</a></span></h3> <h3><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:beautiful-future">其三 纪行</a></span></h3> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3662783&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609314932" alt="TimeElapsed" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3662783)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timeelapsed" >TimeElapsed</a></span></p> 
