&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;您的页面编辑锁定已失效&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;http://aelanna.com/Tools/deletion-time.html?timestamp=1262275200000&amp;amp;type=2&quot; align=&quot;&quot; frameborder=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot; scrolling=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;width: 400px; height: 50px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
